# A project saved by 0.10.2-beta (tests/fixtures/v0102_store.bin, made in its simulator: drums, motion, a 303 line, a song, and a value in every sound place that has moved since) loads as it was, and saves again in today's format.
wait 100
storeload tests/fixtures/v0102_store.bin
wait 300
# the patterns and the song
expect hit0.0.0 1
expect hit0.0.4 1
expect hit0.0.12 1
expect hit0.1.4 1
expect hit0.1.12 1
expect hit0.1.0 0
expect songlen 2
expect tempo 120
expect lanes 1
# the 909 kick: its pan 8 -> 10, the sends at none
expect sound0.0.10 30
expect sound0.0.8 0
expect sound0.0.9 0
# the 909 snare: DECAY in at 3 (its default), the rest up one
expect sound0.1.4 70
expect sound0.1.7 50
expect sound0.1.9 90
expect sound0.1.3 41
# the 808 kick: its pan 7 -> 9, the sends at none
expect sound1.0.0 100
expect sound1.0.9 20
expect sound1.0.7 0
expect sound1.0.8 0
# T5i (rev 5): the two new parts (FM6, NOISE) get the other parts' level (the BASS strip 74), centred,
# no sends, and the adapter defaults: FM6's macros at their 0 offset, NOISE at its init values
expect sound5.4.0 74
expect sound5.4.1 0
expect sound5.4.2 0
expect sound5.4.3 64
expect sound5.5.0 74
expect sound5.5.3 64
expect sound3.0.0 0
expect sound3.0.1 7
expect sound3.0.2 64
expect sound3.0.3 16
expect sound3.0.4 64
expect sound3.0.5 7
expect sound3.0.6 0
expect sound3.0.7 0
expect sound3.1.0 0
expect sound3.1.1 64
expect sound3.1.2 70
expect sound3.1.3 100
expect sound3.1.4 127
expect sound3.1.5 0
expect sound3.1.6 70
expect sound3.1.7 0
# the master: COMP and FILTER from the details (ratio on: COMP > 0; low-pass: FILTER < 60)
expect sound6.0.0 40
expect sound6.0.12 >0
expect sound6.0.13 <60
# the delay's TAPE from its type and wear
expect sound4.1.0 >16
# it plays, and saves again in the new format
tap PLAY
wait 2000
tap PLAY
tap SAVE
wait 300
reboot
# T7a: back into the classic pages after the reboot.
tap GLO
tap SEL
wait 300
expect sound0.0.10 30
expect sound0.1.4 70
expect sound1.0.9 20
expect sound5.4.0 74
expect sound3.0.1 7
expect sound3.1.4 127
expect songlen 2
expect lanes 1
expect hit0.1.12 1
